WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.689
<v U_UKN>Regulations and laws can affect the day to day operations of many organizations.

2
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:21.430
<v U_UKN>One example of a law with a broad impact is the general data protection regulation.

3
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.829
<v U_UKN>GDPR

4
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.510
<v U_UKN>which affords data protection and control to individuals within

5
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.190
<v U_UKN>the territorial boundaries of the EU regardless of citizenship.

6
00:00:31.079 --> 00:00:33.659
<v U_UKN>As another example in the United States,

7
00:00:33.669 --> 00:00:37.159
<v U_UKN>patient medical information is governed by the health care insurance,

8
00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:40.459
<v U_UKN>Portability and Accountability Act of 1996

9
00:00:40.939 --> 00:00:40.965
<v U_UKN>HIPA

10
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.159
<v U_UKN>and must be closely guarded

11
00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:45.860
<v U_UKN>from the information security perspective.

12
00:00:46.069 --> 00:00:48.720
<v U_UKN>A high standard of professionalism is expected

13
00:00:48.729 --> 00:00:51.119
<v U_UKN>in safeguarding data on the patient's behalf.

14
00:00:51.709 --> 00:00:55.220
<v U_UKN>Information security is based on trust and credibility.

15
00:00:55.569 --> 00:00:56.830
<v U_UKN>If something goes wrong,

16
00:00:57.049 --> 00:01:00.069
<v U_UKN>the stakeholders trust evaporates and organization's

17
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.110
<v U_UKN>credibility is damaged sometimes without cure.

18
00:01:03.779 --> 00:01:03.970
<v U_UKN>HIPA

19
00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:08.190
<v U_UKN>A also carries significant criminal and financial penalties for non

20
00:01:08.199 --> 00:01:11.959
<v U_UKN>compliance for both the organization and the individuals involved.

21
00:01:12.529 --> 00:01:13.489
<v U_UKN>Fortunately,

22
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.599
<v U_UKN>there are published frameworks or standards to guide

23
00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:19.819
<v U_UKN>the organizational policies that support the compliance effort.

24
00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.080
<v U_UKN>Many departments or work groups

25
00:01:22.089 --> 00:01:24.519
<v U_UKN>within the organization implement procedures that

26
00:01:24.529 --> 00:01:28.319
<v U_UKN>detail how they complete day to day tasks while remaining compliant.

27
00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:33.029
<v U_UKN>Among these groups is the International Organization for Standardization

28
00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:33.500
<v U_UKN>ISO

29
00:01:33.629 --> 00:01:33.889
<v U_UKN>O

30
00:01:34.569 --> 00:01:38.550
<v U_UKN>ISO is an international standards body. One of the standards that is

31
00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:42.029
<v U_UKN>o publishes is how to destroy data in a secure fashion.

